WEBVTT - typo3-backend-rights (narration, English)

1
00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:07.956
Editor rights grow for years. One wrong click, and the admin is locked out.

2
00:00:12.656 --> 00:00:16.247
You ask for one main editor role with subgroups.

3
00:00:19.156 --> 00:00:25.960
A read-only audit reads every group, module and page permission, and prints JSON.

4
00:00:27.310 --> 00:00:33.226
The lab fails: three groups, no leaves, 56 findings.

5
00:00:34.276 --> 00:00:40.872
A working administrator always stays. A lockout costs more than any permission gain.

6
00:00:42.472 --> 00:00:45.463
Open source. Clone the skills.
